      "url": "https://www.sharmilarege.com/papers-1990s",
      "usedFor": "Rege's founding statement of the Dalit feminist standpoint: caste-gender nexus, critique of universal 'woman' and of nominalism, standpoint epistemology, caste not collapsed into class."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
