      "title": "Caste and Gender: The Violence Against Women in India (EUI Working Paper RSC 96/17)",
      "author": "Sharmila Rege (1996; author's hosted copy)",
      "url": "https://www.sharmilarege.com/papers-1990s",
      "usedFor": "Brahmanical patriarchy, caste-specific sexual violence, caste and gender as linked issues, critique of the state's treatment of them as separate."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
