      "author": "Ruth Manorama, National Convenor of the National Federation of Dalit Women (hosted by Citizens for Justice and Peace)",
      "url": "https://cjp.org.in/dalit-women-justice-rights-finding-a-voice",
      "usedFor": "Dalit women as 'dalits among the dalits', the autonomous movement, forms of violence and denial of access, demands."
